Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:36.91,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}殺手與忍者在 Dance Dance Dance (Da)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.91,0:20:39.79,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}好不容易閃爍光芒 想要活下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:42.58,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}妳果然很可愛啊 (Foo!)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:45.42,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,150)\3c&HB02A9B&}殺手與忍者在 一 二 三 (Da)
